NuonuoChuuby
============

A macOS rewrite of JiuNuoDesktopPet（啾糯桌宠）, originally a C#/WPF Windows
desktop pet.


Relationship to the upstream project
------------------------------------

This project is a **derivative work**: its behaviour, constants and asset layout
are ported from the upstream application, and it consumes the upstream
repository's assets.

  Upstream:  https://github.com/nicedoctors/JiuNuoDesktopPet
  Licence:   PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 (see LICENSE)
  Pinned:    Vendor/JiuNuoDesktopPet (git submodule)

The upstream licence permits non-commercial use, modification and
redistribution, and prohibits commercial use. It is not an OSI-approved open
source licence. **This project is therefore also non-commercial.**


Character artwork and recordings
--------------------------------

The upstream project's `ASSET_RIGHTS.md` states that no separate permission to
copy, modify or redistribute the character images, designs or audio has been
granted, and that the characters derive from third-party works whose rights
holders have not licensed this use.

In deference to that:

  * **This repository contains no asset bytes.** `.gitignore` excludes
    `Sources/NuonuoChuubyCore/Resources/Assets/`.
  * The committed `asset-manifest.json` lists only *paths* and a pinned commit id.
  * A development build copies assets from the submodule locally.
  * A release build downloads them from the upstream repository on first launch.

Redistribution of the artwork is therefore not performed by this project; the
underlying rights status is unchanged and remains unresolved. Anyone shipping a
build carries that same status.


Third-party code
----------------

No third-party Swift packages are used. The package has no external
dependencies; everything is built on Apple's frameworks (AppKit, CoreGraphics,
CoreServices, AVFoundation) plus the Swift standard library.
